 "remarks": "Charming 4-bedroom home, perfect for remote work or study. This cozy home features a spacious living and dining room combination with plenty of natural light. The kitchen is equipped with stainless steel appliances. Central air conditioning and a walkout basement. Enjoy the convenience of a private backyard and attached garage with remote opener. Located in a quiet neighborhood close to schools, parks, and shopping centers. No pets and no smoking inside the home. Tenant is responsible for electricity, gas for heating and cooking, water, liability insurance, yard maintenance, and snow removal. Credit check required. Available for a new lease starting November 1, 2026.",
